error[R0043]: cannot assign to `rate`, it is declared `const`
--> 24:3: assigned here
    9:7: `rate` declared `const` here
  = note: Luau refuses to compile a file that assigns to a `const` binding, so the whole script fails to load, not only this statement
  = help: declare `rate` with `local` if it has to change, or keep the new value under another name
